                "        compilerArgsLogLevel: KotlinCompilerArgumentsLogLevel,",
                "        toolingDiagnostics: UsesKotlinToolingDiagnosticsParameters,",
                "    ): Pair\u003cExitCode, KotlinCompilerExecutionStrategy> {",
